<% content_for :title, "My launch — APPly" %>
<main id="main" class="wrap inner-page portal-page">
  <%= render "web/shared/member_navigation" %>
  <div class="portal-intro"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR CLINIC LAUNCH, IN MOTION</p><h1>A supported start.<br><em>Your next step is here.</em></h1><p>Your launch paperwork and practical onboarding resources, in one place.</p></div>
  <div class="portal-modules">
    <a href="<%= paperwork_index_path %>" class="portal-module"><span class="module-number">01 / YOUR LAUNCH PACKET</span><h2>Paperwork.</h2><p>Review your assigned documents, track what is started, and complete the signing steps that need you.</p><div class="module-progress"><span><%= @paperworks.where.not(signed_at: nil).count %> of <%= @paperworks.count %> completed</span><span>Open paperwork ↗</span></div></a>
    <a href="<%= training_index_path %>" class="portal-module training-module"><span class="module-number">02 / GET READY TO RUN YOUR CLINIC</span><h2>Onboarding<br>&amp; training.</h2><p>Build confidence with written how-to guides and, later, Kevin's video walkthroughs.</p><div class="module-progress"><span><%= @completed_training %> of <%= @materials.count %> guides completed</span><span>Explore training ↗</span></div></a>
  </div>
  <section class="portal-bottom"><div><h2>Your clinic, day to day.</h2><p>Switch to the separate workspace for EHR, inventory, and employee management.</p></div><a href="/clinic" class="text-link">Open clinic workspace ↗</a></section>
  <p class="portal-boundary">This launch portal contains no patient records. Clinic operations have a separate interface and access boundary. The packaged clinic product remains separately scoped and sold.</p>
</main>
